Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:41:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 188/202] [ae-patch] Pin a family's open sessions with its
 lead, as a setting

Settings > Chat gains "Pin a lead's family" (Yes or No, saved on this device, No by default). With Yes, pinning a session that leads a family also pins its open sessions, lead first; reference and archived ones stay unpinned, and a family that needs more pin spots than are free pins nothing and says so. Unpinning the lead unpins every pinned session of the family, with one Undo that re-pins them where they were. The family comes from the same fresh read the archive cascade uses, now in web/src/lib/aeFamilyRead.ts.
